DOC options-step advanced	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.advanced.description	Settings you typically touch once: sensors, the building and its thermal model, solar panels, self-learning and the control hardware.
DOC options-step away	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.away.description	A week away is the biggest single saving a heating system can offer.
DOC options-step building	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.building.description	Everything between the heat sources and the emitters: the mixing valve, the buffer tank as a store, and the wood furnace tank with its probes.
DOC options-step building_preset	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.building_preset.description	Describe the building — what it is built from, roughly when it was built, its foundation, heated area and how each floor is heated — and the thermal model's numbers are worked out for you.
DOC options-step comfort	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.comfort.description	How warm you want the house, and how far the optimizer may drift from that to save money.
DOC options-step entities	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.entities.description	Choose which Home Assistant entities the optimizer uses: mostly sensors it reads, plus the heat pump on/off switch and the space-heating set-point entity, which it can write.
DOC options-step entities_metering	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.entities_metering.description	Electrical meters, solar irradiance and compressor frequency.
DOC options-step entities_pump	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.entities_pump.description	What the heat pump reports about itself.
DOC options-step factory_reset	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.factory_reset.description	Return the optimizer to the state of a fresh installation.
DOC options-step grid	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.grid.description	Costs that are not simply the price per kWh.
DOC options-step grid_connection	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.grid_connection.description	Main fuse size, guards against blowing it or exceeding your peak allowance, and the heat pump's own silent mode.
DOC options-step grid_fees	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.grid_fees.description	Time-of-use transfer fees and the contract shadow price.
DOC options-step heat_curve	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.heat_curve.description	Shifts the heat curve up in cheap hours and down in expensive ones, through a Danfoss ECL110 over MQTT, a number entity that offsets your controller's curve, or both.
DOC options-step hot_water	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.hot_water.description	Tell the optimizer when you actually need hot water.
DOC options-step hot_water_pumps	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.hot_water_pumps.description	Schedule the VVC circulation pump.
DOC options-step hot_water_tank	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.hot_water_tank.description	Tank size, cold-water inlet and advanced DHW learning.
DOC options-step init	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.init.description	Pick the group of settings you want to change.
DOC options-step learning	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.learning.description	Watchdogs and optional learning features.
DOC options-step learning_features	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.learning_features.description	Plan-affecting learners that move real heat or physics.
DOC options-step modbus_prefill	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.modbus_prefill.description	For a Rotenso Windmi or another GCHV-built heat pump, read through the tuya_heat_pump project's Modbus package or through the pump's own Home Assistant device.
DOC options-step quick_setup	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.quick_setup.description	The same house questions the initial setup offers, over this entry's existing settings.
DOC options-step setup_overview	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.setup_overview.description	What the optimizer believes your system is, from the current configuration.
DOC options-step solar_pv	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.solar_pv.description	If you have solar, heating hot water or the buffer from surplus production beats exporting it at the compensation rate.
DOC options-step thermal_model	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.thermal_model.description	The raw numbers behind the thermal model, otherwise only asked during setup.
DOC options-step thermal_model_zones	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.thermal_model_zones.description	Zone split, inter-floor transfer and solar orientation.
DOC options-step tuning	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.tuning.description	The trade-off between a cheap bill and a rock-steady temperature.
DOC option away.after_save	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.away.data_description.after_save	Saving writes through immediately; this chooses where the dialog goes next.
DOC option away.away_dhw_min_temperature	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.away.data_description.away_dhw_min_temperature	The anti-legionella cycle still runs on its usual interval; it is not timed to your return.
DOC option away.away_presence_entity	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.away.data_description.away_presence_entity	A person, device tracker, calendar, or occupancy sensor.
DOC option away.away_temperature	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.away.data_description.away_temperature	The hold temperature while away.
DOC option away.holiday_calendar_entity	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.away.data_description.holiday_calendar_entity	When this calendar is on, holiday comfort and holiday hot-water windows replace the weekday/weekend pair for that day.
DOC option building.after_save	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.building.data_description.after_save	Saving writes through immediately; this chooses where the dialog goes next.
DOC option building_preset.after_save	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.building_preset.data_description.after_save	Saving writes through immediately; this chooses where the dialog goes next.
DOC option comfort.after_save	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.comfort.data_description.after_save	Saving writes through immediately; this chooses where the dialog goes next.
DOC option entities.after_save	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.entities.data_description.after_save	Saving writes through immediately; this chooses where the dialog goes next.
DOC option entities_metering.after_save	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.entities_metering.data_description.after_save	Saving writes through immediately; this chooses where the dialog goes next.
DOC option entities_pump.after_save	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.entities_pump.data_description.after_save	Saving writes through immediately; this chooses where the dialog goes next.
DOC option entities_pump.dhw_hysteresis_entity	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.entities_pump.data_description.dhw_hysteresis_entity	Optional.
DOC option entities_pump.heat_pump_backup_heater_entity	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.entities_pump.data_description.heat_pump_backup_heater_entity	Optional.
DOC option entities_pump.heat_pump_capacity_limited_entity	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.entities_pump.data_description.heat_pump_capacity_limited_entity	Optional.
DOC option entities_pump.heat_pump_defrost_entity	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.entities_pump.data_description.heat_pump_defrost_entity	Optional.
DOC option entities_pump.heat_pump_dhw_booster_entity	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.entities_pump.data_description.heat_pump_dhw_booster_entity	Optional.
DOC option entities_pump.heat_pump_fault_entity	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.entities_pump.data_description.heat_pump_fault_entity	Optional.
DOC option entities_pump.heat_pump_mode_entity	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.entities_pump.data_description.heat_pump_mode_entity	Optional.
DOC option entities_pump.heat_pump_online_entity	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.entities_pump.data_description.heat_pump_online_entity	Optional, and strongly recommended for a cloud-connected pump.
DOC option entities_pump.heat_pump_return_temp_entity	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.entities_pump.data_description.heat_pump_return_temp_entity	Optional.
DOC option entities_pump.heat_pump_supply_temp_entity	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.entities_pump.data_description.heat_pump_supply_temp_entity	Optional.
DOC option entities_pump.pump_duty_mode	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.entities_pump.data_description.pump_duty_mode	Off (the default) never writes the pump's operating mode or set-points.
DOC option entities_pump.space_hysteresis_entity	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.entities_pump.data_description.space_hysteresis_entity	Optional.
DOC option factory_reset.confirm	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.factory_reset.data_description.confirm	Nothing changes unless this is ticked: submitted unticked, the menu comes back.
DOC option factory_reset.scope	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.factory_reset.data_description.scope	Settings, learned values, or both.
DOC option grid.after_save	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.grid.data_description.after_save	Saving writes through immediately; this chooses where the dialog goes next.
DOC option grid.peak_tariff_distinct_days	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.grid.data_description.peak_tariff_distinct_days	Most Swedish tariffs count the highest hour of each of three different days, so a cold morning with three high hours is one peak, not three.
DOC option grid.peak_tariff_enabled	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.grid.data_description.peak_tariff_enabled	Adds your grid company's monthly power-peak fee to the objective, so flattening peaks is worth actual money.
DOC option grid.peak_tariff_hours	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.grid.data_description.peak_tariff_hours	For example "07:00-19:00".
DOC option grid.peak_tariff_months	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.grid.data_description.peak_tariff_months	For example "Nov-Mar".
DOC option grid.peak_tariff_offpeak_factor	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.grid.data_description.peak_tariff_offpeak_factor	1.0 treats every hour the same.
DOC option grid.peak_tariff_peaks_averaged	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.grid.data_description.peak_tariff_peaks_averaged	Most Swedish tariffs average the three highest hours of the month.
DOC option grid.peak_tariff_price_per_kw	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.grid.data_description.peak_tariff_price_per_kw	Take this from your grid invoice — it varies a lot between grid companies.
DOC option grid.peak_tariff_weekdays_only	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.grid.data_description.peak_tariff_weekdays_only	Many Swedish tariffs only bill weekday peaks.
DOC option grid.peak_tariff_window_minutes	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.grid.data_description.peak_tariff_window_minutes	Hourly for most tariffs.
DOC option grid_connection.after_save	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.grid_connection.data_description.after_save	Saving writes through immediately; this chooses where the dialog goes next.
DOC option grid_connection.fuse_guard_enabled	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.grid_connection.data_description.fuse_guard_enabled	Caps the heat pump's planned power at what the fuse leaves after the rest of the house.
DOC option grid_connection.main_fuse_amperes	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.grid_connection.data_description.main_fuse_amperes	The house's main fuse in amperes, from your grid contract.
DOC option grid_connection.main_fuse_phases	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.grid_connection.data_description.main_fuse_phases	Nearly every Swedish house is 3-phase.
DOC option grid_connection.peak_guard_enabled	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.grid_connection.data_description.peak_guard_enabled	Watches the power meter live and, when the current metering window is projected to set a new billed peak, holds back electric hot water and nudges the heat curve down for the rest of that window.
DOC option grid_connection.peak_guard_margin_kw	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.grid_connection.data_description.peak_guard_margin_kw	How far below the billed threshold the guard starts acting.
DOC option grid_connection.silent_mode_power_fraction	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.grid_connection.data_description.silent_mode_power_fraction	The share of the heat pump's maximum electrical power it still runs at inside the silent mode schedule.
DOC option grid_connection.silent_mode_windows	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.grid_connection.data_description.silent_mode_windows	When the heat pump's own silent or night mode caps the compressor, written like the hot water time frames, for example "22:00-06:00".
DOC option grid_fees.after_save	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.grid_fees.data_description.after_save	Saving writes through immediately; this chooses where the dialog goes next.
DOC option grid_fees.contract_fixed_price	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.grid_fees.data_description.contract_fixed_price	If you could have a fixed-price contract, its {currency}/kWh.
DOC option grid_fees.dso_product	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.grid_fees.data_description.dso_product	A dated Sweden-only table.
DOC option grid_fees.grid_fee_entity	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.grid_fees.data_description.grid_fee_entity	A sensor reporting the current fee in {currency}/kWh, for grids with dynamic fees.
DOC option grid_fees.grid_fee_fixed	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.grid_fees.data_description.grid_fee_fixed	A flat fee added in every hour, on top of the time-of-use rules or the live sensor's value.
DOC option grid_fees.grid_fee_mode	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.grid_fees.data_description.grid_fee_mode	The fee your grid company adds per kWh transferred.
DOC option grid_fees.grid_fee_rules	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.grid_fees.data_description.grid_fee_rules	One rule per line, for example "Nov-Mar Mon-Fri 06:00-22:00 = 0.25".
DOC option heat_curve.after_save	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.heat_curve.data_description.after_save	Saving writes through immediately; this chooses where the dialog goes next.
DOC option heat_curve.ecl110_command_topic	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.heat_curve.data_description.ecl110_command_topic	Only needed for older setups that expect a JSON payload instead.
DOC option heat_curve.ecl110_displace_max	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.heat_curve.data_description.ecl110_displace_max	How far the heat curve may be shifted up when storing cheap heat.
DOC option heat_curve.ecl110_displace_min	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.heat_curve.data_description.ecl110_displace_min	How far the heat curve may be shifted down during expensive hours.
DOC option heat_curve.ecl110_displace_set_topic	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.heat_curve.data_description.ecl110_displace_set_topic	MQTT topic the parallel heat-curve offset is published to.
DOC option heat_curve.ecl110_mqtt_qos	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.heat_curve.data_description.ecl110_mqtt_qos	0 is fine for almost everyone.
DOC option heat_curve.ecl110_mqtt_retain	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.heat_curve.data_description.ecl110_mqtt_retain	Keeps the last offset on the broker so the controller picks it up after a restart.
DOC option heat_curve.ecl110_pid_time_constant_hours	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.heat_curve.data_description.ecl110_pid_time_constant_hours	Roughly how long the controller takes to act on a new offset.
DOC option heat_curve.ecl110_state_topic	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.heat_curve.data_description.ecl110_state_topic	MQTT topic the controller reports its current state on.
DOC option heat_curve.heat_curve_displace_entity	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.heat_curve.data_description.heat_curve_displace_entity	A number entity that shifts your controller's heat curve.
DOC option heat_curve.heat_curve_offset_band_k	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.heat_curve.data_description.heat_curve_offset_band_k	The offset written to the entity stays within this many kelvin either way.
DOC option heat_curve.heat_curve_persistent_band_k	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.heat_curve.data_description.heat_curve_persistent_band_k	The stored setting is moved at most this many kelvin either way from the value it held before the first write.
DOC option heat_curve.heat_curve_persistent_min_dwell_minutes	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.heat_curve.data_description.heat_curve_persistent_min_dwell_minutes	After a write, the next waits at least this long.
DOC option heat_curve.heat_curve_persistent_writes_per_day	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.heat_curve.data_description.heat_curve_persistent_writes_per_day	Writes in one local day, the write back on off included; one is always kept for it.
DOC option heat_curve.heat_curve_target_kind	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.heat_curve.data_description.heat_curve_target_kind	Offset: a temperature difference, 0 neutral, not stored by the controller.
DOC option hot_water.after_save	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.hot_water.data_description.after_save	Saving writes through immediately; this chooses where the dialog goes next.
DOC option hot_water_pumps.after_save	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.hot_water_pumps.data_description.after_save	Saving writes through immediately; this chooses where the dialog goes next.
DOC option hot_water_pumps.vvc_lead_minutes	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.hot_water_pumps.data_description.vvc_lead_minutes	How long before a hot water time frame the circulation pump starts, so the loop is already hot when the time frame opens.
DOC option hot_water_pumps.vvc_pump_entity	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.hot_water_pumps.data_description.vvc_pump_entity	A switch controlling the hot water circulation (VVC) loop pump.
DOC option hot_water_tank.after_save	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.hot_water_tank.data_description.after_save	Saving writes through immediately; this chooses where the dialog goes next.
DOC option learning.after_save	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.learning.data_description.after_save	Saving writes through immediately; this chooses where the dialog goes next.
DOC option learning.comfort_learning_enabled	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.learning.data_description.comfort_learning_enabled	Every time you override the temperature, you are saying the plan went too far in one direction.
DOC option learning.debug_collect_enabled	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.learning.data_description.debug_collect_enabled	Records one small row per optimization cycle and one full snapshot a day for seven days, then stops by itself.
DOC option learning.price_prior_enabled	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.learning.data_description.price_prior_enabled	Tomorrow's prices arrive around 13:00.
DOC option learning.staleness_max_age_scale	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.learning.data_description.staleness_max_age_scale	Raise this if you have sensors that deliberately report rarely and are being flagged unnecessarily.
DOC option learning.staleness_watchdog_enabled	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.learning.data_description.staleness_watchdog_enabled	A dead battery leaves a perfectly normal-looking value in place forever.
DOC option learning.system_identification_enabled	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.learning.data_description.system_identification_enabled	Lets the optimizer run a small deliberate heating step on a mild, cheap night to measure your house directly, instead of waiting weeks to infer it.
DOC option learning_features.after_save	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.learning_features.data_description.after_save	Saving writes through immediately; this chooses where the dialog goes next.
DOC option modbus_prefill.after_save	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.modbus_prefill.data_description.after_save	Saving writes through immediately; this chooses where the dialog goes next.
DOC option modbus_prefill.compressor_freq_sensor	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.modbus_prefill.data_description.compressor_freq_sensor	The package's actual compressor frequency sensor, suggested only while this slot is empty.
DOC option modbus_prefill.dhw_legionella_interval_days	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.modbus_prefill.data_description.dhw_legionella_interval_days	Seven days divided by the number of days set in the pump's anti-legionella schedule (02CAH), rounded down.
DOC option modbus_prefill.dhw_legionella_temperature	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.modbus_prefill.data_description.dhw_legionella_temperature	Read from the pump's DHW anti-legionella setpoint register (0195H), times 0.1.
DOC option modbus_prefill.dhw_min_temperature	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.modbus_prefill.data_description.dhw_min_temperature	Read from the pump's DHW economic setpoint register (0196H), times 0.1.
DOC option modbus_prefill.dhw_setpoint	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.modbus_prefill.data_description.dhw_setpoint	Read from the pump's DHW normal setpoint register (0194H), times 0.1.
DOC option modbus_prefill.dhw_temp_entity	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.modbus_prefill.data_description.dhw_temp_entity	The package's hot water tank temperature sensor, suggested only while this slot is empty.
DOC option modbus_prefill.dhw_windows	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.modbus_prefill.data_description.dhw_windows	Read from the pump's DHW schedule start and stop registers (02C8H, 02C9H), each hour times 256 plus minute, only while that schedule has a day set.
DOC option modbus_prefill.heat_pump_capacity_limited_entity	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.modbus_prefill.data_description.heat_pump_capacity_limited_entity	The package's night mode (frequency reduction) active sensor, suggested only while this slot is empty.
DOC option modbus_prefill.heat_pump_max_power	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.modbus_prefill.data_description.heat_pump_max_power	The pump's unit capacity register, in kW of heat, divided by the nominal COP in force.
DOC option modbus_prefill.heat_pump_return_temp_entity	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.modbus_prefill.data_description.heat_pump_return_temp_entity	The package's entering water temperature (Tw-in) sensor, suggested only while this slot is empty.
DOC option modbus_prefill.heat_pump_supply_temp_entity	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.modbus_prefill.data_description.heat_pump_supply_temp_entity	The package's leaving water temperature (T1) sensor, suggested only while this slot is empty.
DOC option modbus_prefill.mixing_valve_write_target_kind	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.modbus_prefill.data_description.mixing_valve_write_target_kind	Suggested as flow on water temperature control, only where the two-zone model the building page requires for it is configured.
DOC option modbus_prefill.modbus_prefill_prefix	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.modbus_prefill.data_description.modbus_prefill_prefix	The start of the package's entity ids: "hp" for sensor.hp_outdoor_air_temperature.
DOC option modbus_prefill.outdoor_temp_entity	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.modbus_prefill.data_description.outdoor_temp_entity	The package's outdoor air temperature sensor, suggested only while this slot is empty.
DOC option modbus_prefill.prefill_device	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.modbus_prefill.data_description.prefill_device	Pick the heat pump's own device to read its entities instead of a Modbus package.
DOC option modbus_prefill.prefill_offer	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.modbus_prefill.data_description.prefill_offer	When on, setting up a new entry offers this page if a heat-pump device added to this install can fill any of these settings.
DOC option modbus_prefill.silent_mode_windows	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.modbus_prefill.data_description.silent_mode_windows	Read from the pump's night mode start and end registers (0206H, 0207H), each hour times 256 plus minute.
DOC option modbus_prefill.space_setpoint_unit	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.modbus_prefill.data_description.space_setpoint_unit	Suggested as flow when the pump's control mode register (100DH) is water temperature control.
DOC option quick_setup.after_save	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.quick_setup.data_description.after_save	Saving writes through immediately; this chooses where the dialog goes next.
DOC option quick_setup.buffer_tank	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.quick_setup.data_description.buffer_tank	A tank between the heat pump and the heating circuits, large enough to store heat.
DOC option quick_setup.building_era	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.quick_setup.data_description.building_era	Construction era is a good proxy for insulation standard, and a far better starting point than a single default.
DOC option quick_setup.building_foundation	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.quick_setup.data_description.building_foundation	A crawl space adds heat loss; a heated basement adds both loss area and thermal mass.
DOC option quick_setup.building_structure	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.quick_setup.data_description.building_structure	Heavy materials inside the insulation store heat, which is what lets the optimizer buy it cheaply and use it later.
DOC option quick_setup.dhw_tank	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.quick_setup.data_description.dhw_tank	A tank the heat pump keeps full of domestic hot water.
DOC option quick_setup.heated_area_m2	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.quick_setup.data_description.heated_area_m2	Everything is scaled by this, so it is the number worth getting closest to right.
DOC option quick_setup.lower_floor_emitter	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.quick_setup.data_description.lower_floor_emitter	A heated slab is a large store that gets actively charged, so it makes pre-heating both more valuable and more necessary.
DOC option quick_setup.two_zone	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.quick_setup.data_description.two_zone	On for a house with two separately heated floors, off for one.
DOC option quick_setup.upper_floor_emitter	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.quick_setup.data_description.upper_floor_emitter	Radiators respond in minutes, floor heating in hours.
DOC option quick_setup.wood_buffer_tank	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.quick_setup.data_description.wood_buffer_tank	A second tank the wood furnace heats, separate from the heat pump's buffer.
DOC option quick_setup.wood_furnace	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.quick_setup.data_description.wood_furnace	A wood furnace that heats the same water loop.
DOC option quick_setup.wood_tank_bottom_entity	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.quick_setup.data_description.wood_tank_bottom_entity	See the top sensor.
DOC option quick_setup.wood_tank_top_entity	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.quick_setup.data_description.wood_tank_top_entity	Together with the bottom sensor this gives the heat left in the wood tank: the average of the two readings, counted only above the buffer tank temperature plus 2 °C.
DOC option solar_pv.after_save	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.solar_pv.data_description.after_save	Saving writes through immediately; this chooses where the dialog goes next.
DOC option solar_pv.pv_enabled	custom_components/heatpump_optimizer/strings.json:options.step.solar_pv.data_description.pv_enabled	Lets the plan run the heat pump on your own surplus instead of selling it for less than bought power costs.
